WEBVTT

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:31.082
But as the trading circle
grew beyond one village,

00:03:31.082 --> 00:03:36.545
money's key characteristics
changed and evolved.

00:03:36.921 --> 00:03:42.468
Money not only needed
to reliably store value

00:03:42.468 --> 00:03:45.721
but also be easy to convert

00:03:45.721 --> 00:03:48.349
and easy to transport.

00:03:49.517 --> 00:03:51.394
That is when we --

00:03:51.394 --> 00:03:52.853
civilization --

00:03:52.853 --> 00:03:56.065
moved towards coin and paper money.

00:03:56.857 --> 00:04:01.737
But coin and paper money get value